id: pm-pg9599
title: "GH-911: preserve runtime dependency resolution in post-install activation probes"
description: "GitHub #911 reports that the isolated temporary module-graph copy severs npm-hoisted runtime dependencies, falsely returning ok:false for working extensions and leaking temporary copies. Probe the installed runtime topology or reproduce its dependency closure, and clean every temporary graph."
type: Issue
status: closed
priority: 1
tags: []
