author: "harness:codex"
estimated_minutes: 180
acceptance_criteria: A local npm package with a hoisted declared runtime dependency installs with truthful activation status; real load failures still fail; temporary graph directories are always removed; packed npm/local/cross-platform tests pass.
resolution: fixed
expected_result: "All acceptance criteria are satisfied with local, manual, and hosted evidence."
actual_result: "Packed and manual extension installs resolve hoisted runtime dependencies truthfully, retain real failure reporting, and leave zero snapshot residue."
